{:edb/db-before-t 3694 :edb/db-after-t 3695 :edb/tx-data [[13194139537007 50 #inst "2026-10-18T03:11:52.293Z" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186100888 1038 #edb/ref 17592186577232 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186100888 1038 #edb/ref 17592186577237 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186100888 1038 #edb/ref 17592186577247 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186100888 1038 #edb/ref 17592186577251 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186100888 1038 #edb/ref 17592186577256 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577230 1080 "false" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577230 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577230 1083 #uuid "012ee319-d5b4-5251-8af3-035e65ebf728" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577231 1080 "true" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577231 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577231 1083 #uuid "034928a0-9dc8-51ff-bda9-34616932d014" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577232 1068 #edb/ref 17592186577239 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577232 1068 #edb/ref 17592186577244 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577232 1068 #edb/ref 17592186577269 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577232 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577232 1071 "Consider the following differential equation.\n\n$$\ny\\prime=\\frac{5 y}{x},\\qquad x\\ne 0\n$$\n\nLet $f(x)=- 4 x^{5}.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $f\\prime(x)=- 16 x^{4}.$\n- **II.** Substituting $y=f(x)$ and $y\\prime=f\\prime(x)$ into the differential equation gives a true statement.\n- **III.** The function $y=f(x)$ is a solution of the differential equation." 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577232 1072 #uuid "08c38953-f704-56cc-b3e1-73f07fd4a27c" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577232 1074 "For a function $f(x)$ to be a solution to a differential equation, it must satisfy the equation for all values of $x$ in an interval where the function is defined and the equation is valid.\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false. Differentiating $f(x)=- 4 x^{5},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f\\prime(x)&=\\left(- 4 x^{5}\\right)\\prime \\\\ &=-4\\cdot 5 x^{4} \\\\ &=- 20 x^{4} \\\\ &\\not\\equiv - 16 x^{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. Substituting $y=- 4 x^{5}$ and $y\\prime=- 20 x^{4}$ into the original equation gives an identity:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y\\prime &\\overset{?}{=}\\frac{5 y}{x} \\\\ - 20 x^{4} &\\overset{?}{=}\\frac{5\\left(- 4 x^{5}\\right)}{x} \\\\ - 20 x^{4} &=- 20 x^{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. Since statement II is true, the function $y=- 4 x^{5}$ is a solution to our differential equation.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577233 1080 "false" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577233 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577233 1083 #uuid "096fa35e-adf0-56ac-96a6-f0d914653171" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577234 1080 "true" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577234 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577234 1083 #uuid "144251c2-9709-58d2-a1b8-7cfd771764df" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577235 1075 #edb/ref 17592186577233 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577235 1075 #edb/ref 17592186577254 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577235 1076 #edb/ref 17592186408166 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577235 1077 "III" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577235 1078 #edb/ref 17592186577233 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577235 1079 #uuid "14afc219-898a-5f29-a488-e9de74e30fc4" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577236 1075 #edb/ref 1759218657