}{=}\\frac{5 y}{x} \\\\ - 16 x &\\overset{?}{=}\\frac{5\\left(- 8 x^{2}\\right)}{x} \\\\ - 16 x &\\not\\equiv - 40 x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false. Since statement II is false, the function $y=- 8 x^{2}$ is not a solution to our differential equation.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577238 1080 "false" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577238 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577238 1083 #uuid "2cb86bec-67e2-5f02-9a89-601383bc948d" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577239 1075 #edb/ref 17592186577260 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577239 1075 #edb/ref 17592186577276 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577239 1076 #edb/ref 17592186408166 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577239 1077 "II" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577239 1078 #edb/ref 17592186577260 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577239 1079 #uuid "2f0af7fc-a183-5432-8aa6-90714a3b16d0" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577240 1080 "false" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577240 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577240 1083 #uuid "309fec51-949f-5aa2-9e56-7b7ab05da2dc" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577241 1080 "false" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577241 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577241 1083 #uuid "32789ef3-e490-5af2-bd76-0010e6157806" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577242 1075 #edb/ref 17592186577262 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577242 1075 #edb/ref 17592186577263 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577242 1076 #edb/ref 17592186408166 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577242 1077 "I" 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577242 1078 #edb/ref 17592186577262 13194139537007 17592186045443 true] [17592186577242 1079 #uuid "32